      "description": "The SMART Guidelines knowledge-graph schema, L1 3.0, as Zod: `src/` (the L1 layer and its `l1-library` extension, the graph-document shape, `validate.ts`, `kgid.ts`, the offline JSON-LD loader and the emitters), `test/`, and `generated/l1/` (the ontology JSON, the document JSON Schema and the JSON-LD contexts, written by `src/emit.ts`), with its own `package.json` for `kg.yml`. The emitter also writes the IG's FSH (`input/fsh/models/KGL1*.fsh`, `input/fsh/codesystems/KG*.fsh`, `input/fsh/valuesets/KG*VS.fsh`), which stays at the repository root with the rest of the IG. Moved here from the repository root `kg/` on the owner's ruling F1 (2026-10-15): `scripts/l1-recommendation-candidates.ts` imports `kg/src/`, and a remote mount brings declared directories only, so a root `kg/` never arrived in an index.",
